    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the tip. i'm doing the water thing now. but the blisters are starting to look kind of big and they're spreading a bit... it's still stinging really intense. do you think i really need to go to a doctor for this? it's just a kitchen accident, seems like it should just heal on its own if i keep it clean right?",
